OL,3,AHow That's Life! gave Esther Rantzen a
OL,4,Acareer-defining moment
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of her most memorable career
OL,7,Fmoments came during one particular
OL,8,Fepisode in 1988 - the footage of which
OL,9,Fhas gone viral several times over in
OL,10,Frecent years.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/38
