OL,3,AUS Supreme Court allows execution of
OL,4,AChrista Pike to go ahead
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US Supreme Court has cleared the
OL,7,Fway for death row inmate Christa Pike
OL,8,Fto become the first woman executed in
OL,9,FTennessee in more than 200 years.
OL,11,FThe justices overturned a last-minute
OL,12,Freprieve that was granted by an appeals
OL,13,Fcourt on Wednesday morning about an
OL,14,Fhour before Pike, 50, was due to be put
OL,15,Fto death.
OL,17,FTennessee's attorney general had asked
OL,18,Fthe Supreme Court to overrule the lower
OL,19,Fcourt. Pike was sentenced to death in
OL,20,F1996 for the murder of Colleen Slemmer.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
